@attribute [Route(WebUiModule.AppearancePath)]
@attribute [Authorize]

@*
    The appearance among the settings (FR-UI-2). The page is where the choice of a theme will
    be, and says how the pages look until then. It has no form, stores nothing, and follows
    nothing. Its texts are in AppearancePages.
*@

<PageTitle>@Screens.Appearance.Name</PageTitle>

<h1>@Screens.Appearance.Name</h1>

<p>@AppearancePages.FollowsDevice</p>

<p>@AppearancePages.NotBuiltYet</p>
